Comment: According to the maintainer's 2026-10-12 declaration these artworks
 were generated with ChatGPT for VDR-Suite. Their generation history is not
 proof of an exclusive copyright, third-party input clearance, or an
 independently verified GPL grant. Eleven SVG assets include the ten genre
 posters and sprite. The genre SVGs are staged by mk/install.mk into the daemon package;
 the separate remote PNG is tracked source but is not among the explicit
 daemon install rules examined here. Review source inputs, any third-party
 reference rights and proposed reuse terms before distribution.

